     "type": "concept",
     "title": "Born From the DRG Revolution",
     "content": "CDI did not exist as a formal discipline until the reimbursement system itself demanded it. In **1983**, Congress created the **Inpatient Prospective Payment System (IPPS)**, paying hospitals a flat fee per case based on **Diagnosis-Related Groups (DRGs)** instead of reimbursing for every individual service rendered.\n\nBy the early **1990s**, hospitals realized that two patients with an identical clinical course could generate very different DRGs depending purely on documentation specificity. The first formal CDI programs - then often called \"concurrent coding\" or \"clinical documentation management\" programs - appeared in the mid-1990s at large academic medical centers.\n\nThe field expanded rapidly after **2007**, when CMS introduced **MS-DRGs (Medicare Severity DRGs)**, a system that explicitly rewards documentation of complications and comorbidities with higher-weighted DRGs. Then **2015**'s transition to **ICD-10-CM/PCS** - with roughly five times as many diagnosis codes as ICD-9 - made specificity even more critical, cementing CDI as essential infrastructure in nearly every acute-care hospital in the United States.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">THE HISTORY OF CDI</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Four milestones that built the field</text><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"980\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"250\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#6366f1\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">1983</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">IPPS &amp;</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">DRGs begin</text><circle cx=\"420\" cy=\"250\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\"/><text x=\"420\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">early 1990s</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">First formal</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">CDI programs</text><circle cx=\"660\" cy=\"250\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#10b981\"/><text x=\"660\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">2007</text><text x=\"660\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">MS-DRGs</text><text x=\"660\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">reward severity</text><circle cx=\"900\" cy=\"250\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><text x=\"900\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">2015</text><text x=\"900\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">ICD-10-CM/PCS</text><text x=\"900\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">go-live</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"420\" width=\"860\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\">Before DRGs: hospitals billed per service</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">After DRGs: hospitals are paid a flat rate per case</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"545\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Documentation specificity now directly drives payment</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"600\" width=\"860\" height=\"140\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.1)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\">ICD-10-CM/PCS: ~5x more codes than ICD-9</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"690\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">Precision in wording now matters more than ever</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\">Result: CDI became essential hospital infrastructure</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The timeline that gave rise to Clinical Documentation Improvement"
     }
