     "explanation": "Coders assign codes based on the whole record, but if the most specific diagnosis only appears in an earlier note and is contradicted or simplified later, that ambiguity needs physician clarification through a compliant query. Coders and CDI specialists cannot assume or infer a diagnosis that isn't clearly and consistently documented - the physician must confirm it explicitly.",
