      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">THE CDI TECHNOLOGY STACK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"95\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Tools that make full coverage possible</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"150\" width=\"440\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\">WORKFLOW SOFTWARE</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">Worklists, working DRGs,</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">query status tracking</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"13\">e.g., 3M 360, Iodine</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"150\" width=\"440\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\">CAC / NLP TOOLS</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">Scans free-text notes,</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">flags potential gaps</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"13\">Speeds up initial scan</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"360\" width=\"440\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"405\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\">ENCODER SOFTWARE</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">Cross-references codes,</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">guidelines, grouper logic</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"13\">Shows DRG impact live</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"360\" width=\"440\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"405\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\">ANALYTICS DASHBOARDS</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"450\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">Query rate, response rate,</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">CMI trend, CC/MCC capture</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"580\" width=\"800\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"630\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"bold\">Technology flags patterns.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"675\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Only a trained specialist decides if a pattern</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"710\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">is a real, evidence-supported opportunity</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The technology that supports, but never replaces, CDI clinical judgment"
