     "explanation": "A concentrated root cause like late query responses points to a process/timing issue in the workflow — the query turnaround window doesn't align with the coding deadline — not a competency problem with any individual. This is exactly the kind of insight root-cause trending is designed to surface, and it typically leads to a workflow fix (like a query deadline policy) rather than individual retraining.",
