      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">TECHNOLOGY IN MODERN CDI</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"110\" width=\"940\" height=\"115\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"19\">CAC — Computer-Assisted Coding</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Suggests codes automatically; coder validates</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">Speeds initial assignment, doesn't replace judgment</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"240\" width=\"940\" height=\"115\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"19\">NLP — Natural Language Processing</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Scans free-text notes for clinical indicators</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">Flags potential query opportunities</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"370\" width=\"940\" height=\"115\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"410\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"19\">AI-Assisted Concurrent Review</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"445\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Prioritizes worklists, drafts query language</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">Human review and edit required, always</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"520\" width=\"860\" height=\"140\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"565\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"19\">AI augments — it doesn't replace</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">A machine can't be held liable under the FCA.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"630\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">A human always can.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "How AI is reshaping — not replacing — the CDI role"
