      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"28\">YOUR CERTIFICATION PATH</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"110\" width=\"440\" height=\"280\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">CCDS</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">Offered by ACDIS</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">RN/RHIA/RHIT/MD license</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">+ 2 yrs CDI experience</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">~100 MCQ exam</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">Popular with nursing background</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"110\" width=\"440\" height=\"280\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">CDIP</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">Offered by AHIMA</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">Clinical/HIM credential</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">+ CDI experience</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"15\">DRG/HCC methodology focus</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"14\">Popular with HIM/coding background</text><rect x=\"120\" y=\"420\" width=\"860\" height=\"110\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"465\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"18\">30-40 CE hours every 2 years</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"16\">Keeps you current as CMS updates models annually</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"560\" width=\"740\" height=\"90\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"612\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"18\">Many senior leaders eventually hold both</text></svg>",
      "caption": "CCDS and CDIP — the two credentials that open doors"
